; error: 11:5: 'Point.grow' changes the value it is called on, so it needs a place that can change, and 'x' is a 'bind&' parameter, which only reads the caller's place; write 'hold& x: Point' to change it
shape Point
    x: int

    alters grow(fixed& by: Point)
        .x = .x + by.x
    fi
fi

task f(fixed& x: Point)
    x.grow(&x)
fi
